    <div class="certificate-number">
        证书编号: <strong>JY-FC-2025-ZA-00076</strong>
    </div>
    
    <div class="title">特种设备制造监督检验证书</div>
    <div class="subtitle">(压力容器受压元件、受压部件)</div>
    <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        Special Equipment Manufacturing Supervision Inspection Certificate<br>
        (Pressure Vessel Pressure-Bearing Components, Pressure-Bearing Parts)
    </div>
    
    <table class="info-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="label">制造单位<br>(Manufacturing Unit)</td>
            <td class="value">江阴市恒达金属压件有限公司<br>(Цзянъинь Хэнда Металл Прессинг Партс Ко., Лтд.)</td>
            <td class="label">产品名称<br>(Product Name)</td>
            <td class="value">椭圆形封头<br>(Эллиптическое днище)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="label">产品编(批)号<br>(Product Code/Batch No.)</td>
            <td class="value"><strong>LA250368-1~12</strong></td>
            <td class="label">型式规格<br>(Model/Specification)</td>
            <td class="value">EHA1800×10</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="label">材料<br>(Material)</td>
            <td class="value">Q345R</td>
